/-! # Cand19: a 3-element countermodel

Generated by `soup.lean_cert` from tables that `soup.check_offline.check_finite` accepted.
Source: `work/check/profile_candidates.json (smallest non-degenerate model, candidate 19)`.

Laws of the theory (· = `f`, ∘ = `g`):
- `x · (y ∘ x) = x ∘ y`
- `x · (y · x) = (x · x) ∘ z`
- `(x · y) · z = (z ∘ x) ∘ x`

Claims refuted:
- `x · y = x`
- `x · y = y`
- `x ∘ y = x`
- `x ∘ y = y`
- `x · y = x ∘ y`
- `x · y = y ∘ x`
